{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["The Missing 8","A devastated world ──\nAndroids and robots live there.\n\"Poppy\" is an android that looks like a human.\nAndroid \"Punkun\" who is not interested in human.\nOne night, a star fell in front of them looking up at the sky ...\n\n\n\nFUZI's original work \"The Missing 8\" born from the Music video is made into a web animation.\n\n\n\n(Source: YouTube description)"],"ja":["The Missing 8",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-50689","ids":{"shikimori":50689,"mal":50689,"anilist":143145,"kodik":"serial-48584"},"kodikIds":["serial-46906","serial-48584"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-46906":"2022-11-30T08:25:14Z","serial-48584":"2023-09-04T20:42:29Z"},"title":"Пропавшая восьмёрка","originalTitle":"The Missing 8","alt":"The Missing 8","description":"Опустошённый мир... В нём живут андроиды и роботы. «Поппи» — андроид, внешне неотличимый от человека. Андроид «Панкун» совершенно не интересуется людьми. И вот однажды ночью, когда они вместе смотрели на небо, перед ними упала звезда...","year":2021,"type":"ONA","genres":["Фантастика"],"rating":6.47,"popularity":2240,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/50689/9dcae0027368cb55cb76263d225b122c.jpeg","width":450,"height":600},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/143145-ZMTH8qCu5my2.jpg","width":1900,"height":400}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-1895","dubId":"1895","label":"FumoDub","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-46906","translationId":"1895","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/1070945/648724491a8cbe287062fa248c2d71a8/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}},{"id":"kodik-2228","dubId":"2228","label":"Freedub Studio","language":"ru","orig